    "stage2_indicators": "Registered validation Hard-L1 ER, distinct two-token prefixes, L3 collision rate, refinement gain, and conditional G3, with paired seed aggregation and directions/minima. These are appropriate registered leading diagnostics under the stated Stage2-only role; no ranking capability is imputed to Stage2.",
    "leakage_protocol": "Manifest states fitting uses training-only inputs, validation only for Stage2 diagnostics, test only for the registered Stage3 test, and excludes future events and prediction-time user context. No leakage blocker identified from the declaration.",
    "causal_link": "The train-only asymmetry/sparsity is explicitly presented as motivation rather than proof; the next-item benefit is registered as a downstream falsifiable Stage3 test. This is a testable design hypothesis, not evidence of an established causal gain."
  }
}
EOF

